% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% The fields of a listing that name the kind (the listing format)
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
"item type" is a field that names the kind,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Item Type (99 listings): the kind of product in the seller's words".
"type" is a field that names the kind,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Type (124 listings): for example".
"category" is a field that names the kind,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Category (16 listings) and Product Type (10 listings)".
"product type" is a field that names the kind,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Category (16 listings) and Product Type (10 listings)".
"features" is a field that names the kind,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Features, Feature, Function, Special Features: for example \"Features: Diecast\", \"Features: Stuffed & Plush\"".
"feature" is a field that names the kind,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Features, Feature, Function, Special Features: for example \"Features: Diecast\", \"Features: Stuffed & Plush\"".
"special features" is a field that names the kind,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Features, Feature, Function, Special Features: for example \"Features: Diecast\", \"Features: Stuffed & Plush\"".
"use" is a field that names the kind,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "Use (39 listings) and Application (27 listings): for example \"Use: Home DIY\", \"Use: Vehicles & Remote Control Toys\"".

