    as stated in HTSUS Chapter 95, confer "Fishing reels and parts and accessories thereof".
"fishing rod" is a word for the kind fishing rod,
    as stated in HTSUS Chapter 95, confer "Fishing rods and parts and accessories thereof".
"fishing rods" is a word for the kind fishing rod,
    as stated in HTSUS Chapter 95, confer "Fishing rods and parts and accessories thereof".
"fish hooks" is a word for the kind fish hook,
    as stated in HTSUS Chapter 95, confer "Fish hooks, whether or not snelled".
"fishing hooks" is a word for the kind fish hook,
    as stated in HTSUS Chapter 95, confer "Fish hooks, whether or not snelled".
"sinker" is a word for the kind fishing sinker,
    as stated in ruling NY N283135, confer "The worm sinker acts as a weight".
"sinkers" is a word for the kind fishing sinker,
    as stated in ruling NY N283135, confer "The tariff classification of fishing sinkers from China".
"landing net" is a word for the kind landing net,
    as stated in ruling NY N340501, confer "is a pear shaped landing net attached to an aluminum pole".

% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Note 5: the words of a toy for animals (pet toys; a cat toy is a
% household article of plastics, NY N360066)
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
"pet toy" is a pet toy word,
    as stated in HTSUS Chapter 95, confer "for example, \"pet toys\"".
"pet toys" is a pet toy word,
    as stated in HTSUS Chapter 95, confer "for example, \"pet toys\"".
"dog toy" is a pet toy word,
    as stated in HTSUS Chapter 95, confer "are identifiable as intended exclusively for animals".
"dog toys" is a pet toy word,
    as stated in HTSUS Chapter 95, confer "are identifiable as intended exclusively for animals".
"cat toy" is a pet toy word,
    as stated in ruling NY N360066, confer "will be marketed and sold as a cat toy".
"cat toys" is a pet toy word,
    as stated in ruling NY N360066, confer "will be marketed and sold as a cat toy".

% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% The rules: a word in the name, in a field, or in the shop's category
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
rule toys_kind_by_name with provenance the other products listing format,
        confer "A listing offers one finished product for sale":
the kind of a good is a kind
    if the good is called a name
    and the name is a word for the kind the kind.

rule toys_kind_by_field with provenance the other products listing format,
        confer "Item Type (99 listings): the kind of product in the seller's words":
the kind of a good is a kind
    if the field a field of the good reads a value
    and the field is a field that names the kind
    and the value is a word for the kind the kind.

rule toys_kind_by_category with provenance the other products listing format,
        confer "It has a title, the categories of the shop, a price, and attributes":
the kind of a good is a kind
    if the good is in the shop category a category
    and the category is a word for the kind the kind.

% "Item Type: Model" in a toys category of the shop: a reduced-scale model
% (heading 9503: "reduced-scale (\"scale\") models and similar recreational
% models")
rule toys_model_in_toys_category with provenance HTSUS Chapter 95,
        confer "and similar recreational models, working or not":
the kind of a good is scale model
    if the field "item type" of the good reads "model"
    and the good is in the shop category a category
    and the category is a category of toys.

% A decoration whose listing names the occasion: made for that festivity
% (heading 9505; "Occasion: Christmas")
rule decoration_occasion_field with provenance the other products listing format,
        confer "Theme (20 listings), Occasion (20 listings)":
a good is marketed as a decoration for an occasion
    if the field "occasion" of the good reads a value
    and the value is a word for the festivity the occasion
    and the kind of the good is a kind
    and the kind is among the decoration kinds.

rule decoration_name with provenance the other products listing format,
        confer "A listing offers one finished product for sale":
a good is marketed as a decoration for an occasion
    if the good is called a name
    and the name is a name of a decoration for the occasion.

% note 5: a listing that names a toy for animals
rule pet_toy_name with provenance HTSUS Chapter 95,
        confer "are identifiable as intended exclusively for animals":
a good is identifiable as intended exclusively for animals
    if the good is called a name
    and the name is a pet toy word.

rule pet_toy_field with provenance HTSUS Chapter 95,
        confer "are identifiable as intended exclusively for animals":
a good is identifiable as intended exclusively for animals
    if the field a field of the good reads a value
    and the field is a field that names the kind
    and the value is a pet toy word.

% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Tests
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

query kinds is:
    the kind of which good is which kind.

query festivities is:
    which good is marketed as a decoration for which festivity.

query pets is:
    which good is identifiable as intended exclusively for animals.

scenario toys is:
    the field "item type" of figure 1 reads "action figures".
    the field "features" of bear 2 reads "stuffed & plush".
    car 3 is in the shop category "toys & hobbies".
    car 3 is in the shop category "remote control toys".
    the field "use" of car 4 reads "vehicles & remote control toys".
    the field "item type" of model 5 reads "model".
    model 5 is in the shop category "toys & hobbies".
    the field "features" of car 6 reads "diecast".
    the field "item type" of set 7 reads "doll accessories".
    blocks 8 is called "building blocks".
    kinds expects answers ["the kind of figure 1 is action figure", "the kind of bear 2 is stuffed toy", "the kind of car 3 is remote-control toy", "the kind of car 4 is remote-control toy", "the kind of model 5 is scale model", "the kind of car 6 is die-cast model", "the kind of set 7 is doll accessory", "the kind of blocks 8 is building blocks"].

scenario games_and_sports is:
    the field "category" of player 1 reads "handheld game players".
    cards 2 is called "playing cards".
    mat 3 is called "yoga mat".
    the field "category" of lure 4 reads "lure".
    reel 5 is called "fishing reel".
    kinds expects answers ["the kind of player 1 is handheld video game machine", "the kind of cards 2 is playing cards", "the kind of mat 3 is yoga mat", "the kind of lure 4 is fishing lure", "the kind of reel 5 is fishing reel"].

scenario festive is:
    the field "item type" of garland 1 reads "garland".
    the field "occasion" of garland 1 reads "christmas".
    decor 2 is called "halloween decorations".
    the field "occasion" of dress 3 reads "christmas".
    ornament 4 is called "christmas ornaments".
    kinds expects answers ["the kind of garland 1 is garland", "the kind of decor 2 is decoration", "the kind of ornament 4 is Christmas ornament"].
    festivities expects answers ["garland 1 is marketed as a decoration for Christmas", "decor 2 is marketed as a decoration for Halloween"].

scenario pets is:
    toy 1 is called "cat toy".
    the field "type" of toy 2 reads "dog toys".
    pets expects answers ["toy 1 is identifiable as intended exclusively for animals", "toy 2 is identifiable as intended exclusively for animals"].
